<title>CANADA: Canadian Sept cargo rises 3pct yr-on yr.</title>
<headline>Canadian Sept cargo rises 3pct yr-on yr.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Airlines International said its September freight traffic was up three percent to 43.7 million cargo ton miles compared with September 1995.</p>
<p>Freight ton miles totalled 42.3 million, while air mail accounted for 1.4 million ton miles. -Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
